  <main_text>
    <l n="1">rem tantum syllabam, literis paululum</l>
    <l n="2">inverfis, pro Sax. þpý, scribentes tobp.</l>
    <l n="3" para="true">
      <i>Blsmer,</i> Opprobrium] Vocem u-</l>
    <l n="4">furparunt Saxones, præcipuè verò, (ut</l>
    <l n="5">nos Blaspbemp) pro contumeliâ in</l>
    <l n="6">Deum, rpnæc addito: calumniam ta-</l>
    <l n="7">men &amp; contumeliam generatim signat.</l>
    <l n="8" para="true">
      <i>Btsa,</i> Turba: ut Gall. <i>Vent de Bize</i>]</l>
    <l n="9">Vide Kilian. verb. bpse, &amp; bpsen. Tur-</l>
    <l n="10">batus Sax. abyrʒóƀ.</l>
    <l n="11" para="true">
      <i>Btspilla,</i> &amp; alibi Spella, Parabola]</l>
    <l n="12">Eâpse notione Sax. bizrpelle. Poste-</l>
    <l n="13">rior hujus compositi syllaba (vox e-</l>
    <l n="14">nim est composita) Historiam, Nar-</l>
    <l n="15">rationem, imprimis notans, in pluribus</l>
    <l n="16">aliis eorum vocibus reperitur, cujus-</l>
    <l n="17">modi sunt Lanrpelle, i.e. doctrina, à</l>
    <l n="18">læpan, docere, (non lepnen, ut Min-</l>
    <l n="19">shæus noster, pro more suo perperam:)</l>
    <l n="20">yoelrpelle, i. e. vana colloquia, ab</l>
    <l n="21">yoel, vanus: zoorpelle, i.e. Evan-</l>
    <l n="22">gelium.</l>
    <l n="23" para="true">
      <i>Blafma,</i> Flamma] Nos blaʒe eo-</l>
    <l n="24">dem sensu, forte à Belg. blaefen, i. e.</l>
    <l n="25">flare, fufflare, quòd fufflatione venti</l>
    <l n="26">flamma fovetur. Saxon. Funale, blara;</l>
    <l n="27">Incendiarius, blýrʒepe.</l>
    <l n="28" para="true">
      <i>Buokestaf,</i> Literatura; vel potiùs ipsa</l>
